sh/2e7ruzavktu\n\nPlease refer to the original setting for personality. Other details are up to you. Just paint in the style you like, feel free. I would be very happy to draw it the way you like!\nThanks for your time. If there is no burden to your schedule and body, I hope you can consider it. If you don't like the commission, you can cancel it directly. It doesn't matter!\nAnd it is best to close the signature in the PSD file! Have a nice day!\n\nLink: https://sta.sh/22fkv8jzuavs", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mozu_mekabu/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 14541, "client_id": 135908, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/152530ac/uploads/origins/91b9deea-09c0-4325-8383-8dd03cfd7cf4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d65a6d38160914ee9abdbd734299b4e1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/152530ac/uploads/origins/91b9deea-09c0-4325-8383-8dd03cfd7cf4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d65a6d38160914ee9abdbd734299b4e1, https://si.imgix.net/152530ac/uploads/origins/91b9deea-09c0-4325-8383-8dd03cfd7cf4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21913681e304136efe0a1ea6041cb52f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/152530ac/uploads/origins/91b9deea-09c0-4325-8383-8dd03cfd7cf4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56f8aa2873f6eee44b778ebcc99500fb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/152530ac/uploads/origins/91b9deea-09c0-4325-8383-8dd03cfd7cf4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bfad693e21f7b6f4292f3f935d1a3824", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/152530ac/uploads/origins/91b9deea-09c0-4325-8383-8dd03cfd7cf4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2